{"title":"Banked Ember","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ashsworn Acolyte, Ashsworn Flamekeeper, Ashsworn Pyromancer</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-acolyte\" title=\"Ashsworn Acolyte - dropped it in 9 of 68 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/02255d14ff8bd6cf9790.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Acolyte</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-flamekeeper\" title=\"Ashsworn Flamekeeper - dropped it in 3 of 25 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/29175ddcade6e6db3652.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Flamekeeper</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-pyromancer\" title=\"Ashsworn Pyromancer - dropped it in 3 of 41 looted corpses (1/14)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/caa8240e09557824956a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Pyromancer</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"banked-ember\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/676a046c065d71a85ae7.svg\" alt=\"Banked Ember\"></div><h3>Banked Ember</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/7/2026, 7:54:25 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}